---
import config from '../data/config.json';
---

<section class="support-section" id="support" aria-label="Support Development">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card support-card text-center">
      <div class="support-icon-wrap mx-auto">
        <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M10 3v2M14 3v2M5 8h14l-1.2 10.1A3.3 3.3 0 0 1 14.5 21h-5a3.3 3.3 0 0 1-3.3-2.9L5 8Z"/>
          <path d="M19 10h1a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-1M8 11v4M12 11v4M16 11v4"/>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <span class="section-label">Voluntary Support</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Enjoying Lirune?</h2>

      <p class="support-lead mx-auto">
        Lirune is built with care as a free, ad-free, open-source reading application. If it has made your reading experience calmer and more enjoyable, you can voluntarily support its continued development.
      </p>

      <div class="support-actions">
        <!-- Buy Me a Coffee official button -->
        <a
          href={config.buyMeACoffeeUrl}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn btn-coffee btn-lg"
          aria-label="Support Lirune Reader on Buy Me a Coffee"
        >
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M10 3v2M14 3v2M5 8h14l-1.2 10.1A3.3 3.3 0 0 1 14.5 21h-5a3.3 3.3 0 0 1-3.3-2.9L5 8Z"/>
            <path d="M19 10h1a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-1M8 11v4M12 11v4M16 11v4"/>
          </svg>
          Buy Me a Coffee
        </a>

        <!-- GitHub Star / Sponsor -->
        <a
          href={config.githubRepo}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg"
          aria-label="Star Lirune on GitHub"
        >
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/>
          </svg>
          Star on GitHub
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="support-disclaimer">
        All financial contributions are entirely voluntary and processed securely on the official Buy Me a Coffee platform. No payment information is collected on the Lirune website.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .support-section {
    padding-top: var(--sp-12);
    padding-bottom: var(--sp-16);
    background: #0E1218;
  }

  .support-card {
    padding: clamp(var(--sp-8), 5vw, var(--sp-16));
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-default);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-surface) 0%, #151A22 100%);
  }

  .support-icon-wrap {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255, 221, 0, 0.12);
    color: var(--color-coffee);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-5);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 221, 0, 0.25);
  }

  .support-lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 620px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-8);
  }

  .support-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--sp-4);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-6);
  }

  .support-disclaimer {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .text-center { text-align: center; }
  .mx-auto { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
</style>
